rules.body:
Preserve ownership across synchronous cleanup and navigation: retire or clear old ownership before external callbacks, and recheck ownership before installing a returned handle. src/panel.js: "visit.handle = null;
  if (handle) handle.cancel();" src/panel.js: "if (state.current === visit) {
    visit.handle = handle;
    publishQueued(state, visit, handle);
  } else {
    handle.cancel();
  }" src/progress-source.js: "// Removal commits before notifying the host. The host callback is synchronous
// and may call workspace.select(...) or workspace.hide(). Repeated removal is inert." Old completion or cleanup must preserve the newer visit's resources.
